<title>USA: Basin finds gas, shuts well on Eugene Isle.</title>
<headline>Basin finds gas, shuts well on Eugene Isle.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basin Exploration Inc on Wednesday said that it would temporarily suspend operations on an exploratory well on Eugene Island Block 64, offshore Louisiana.</p>
<p>The company said it encountered gas in the well and has suspended exploration pending securing a completion rig.</p>
<p>If successful, the well will be tied in to a nearby existing platform and should commence production within 60 days of completion.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
